c exists that is not shared with the Claude User's account\"\n    - when: \"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize that document\"\n    - then: \"Claude displays the message 'This document is not shared with your account'\"\n    - and: \"Claude does not display any content from the document\"\n\n- ac_id: AC-3\n  description: \"Claude must display the message 'The summary timed out - please try again' when no summary is produced within 30 seconds of the Claude User asking for a summary.\"\n  steps:\n    - given: \"a Google Doc is shared with the Claude User's account\"\n    - given: \"the summary backend does not respond within 30 seconds\"\n    - when: \"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize the document\"\n    - then: \"Claude displays the message 'The summary timed out - please try again'\"\n\n- ac_id: AC-4\n  description: \"Claude must state that only the first 10000 words were summarized when the document contains more than 10000 words.\"\n  steps:\n    - given: \"a Google Doc with more than 10000 words is shared with the Claude User's account\"\n    - when: \"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize the document\"\n    - then: \"Claude displays a summary of the first 10000 words\"\n    - and: \"Claude states that only the first 10000 words were summarized\"\n```\n\n=== FILE_END: tmp/{{RUN_DIR}}/01-96.6-fix-prompts.md ===","questions":[]},"ttft_ms":1680,"type":"result","duration_ms":39813,"uuid":"85cd245f-e0ba-4e98-acdb-4e09a117de5e","ttft_stream_ms":1089,"time_to_request_ms":30,"first_content_frame_ms":1089,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
